WEBVTT

00:14:27.333 --> 00:14:30.226
So many other actions available to him.

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:31.268
(Laughter)

00:14:31.292 --> 00:14:34.934
Like, such as, "listens to,"

00:14:34.958 --> 00:14:36.226
"mentors,"

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:40.518
"inspired by, starts joint venture,
everybody rich now."

00:14:40.542 --> 00:14:41.809
(Laughter)

00:14:41.833 --> 00:14:44.268
I want to live in that world
of everybody rich now,

00:14:44.292 --> 00:14:48.208
but because of his poor choice,
we are all in a poorer world.

00:14:49.125 --> 00:14:51.059
Doesn't have to be this way.

00:14:51.083 --> 00:14:55.643
This word game reminded me that
there is a structure to white supremacy,

00:14:55.667 --> 00:14:57.268
as there is to misogyny,

00:14:57.292 --> 00:15:00.643
as there is to all
systemic abuses of power.